<title>NEW ZEALAND: Iddison announces one for eight issue.</title>
<headline>Iddison announces one for eight issue.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iddison Group Ltd said on Tuesday that in conjunction with a one for two rights issue the company had declared a one for eight bonus issue of 50 cent options maturing October 31, 1999.</p>
<p>The record date for entitlements is January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Iddison said it was the directors' intention to seek share and option holder approval to reconstruct all classes of existing 1997 options to the same terms as those announced, thereby creating one class only of 1999 50 cent trading options.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
